1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:10,055
gCaptain reports that China's NewNew Shipping Line has delivered container cargo to Murmansk through the Northern Sea Route for the first time.

2
00:00:10,005 --> 00:00:16,123
The ship sailed from Tianjin with automotive parts and about 500 containers.

3
00:00:16,123 --> 00:00:26,991
The voyage shows growing interest in Arctic shipping, especially from Asian operators seeking alternative links between China, Russia and Europe.

